<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Payment Confirmation - Booking Confirmed</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .success-notice {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Payment Confirmation - Booking Confirmed!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
            
            <div class="success-notice">
                <h3>✅ Payment Successful!</h3>
                <p><strong>Your payment has been processed and your booking is now confirmed!</strong></p>
            </div>

            <p>Thank you for choosing Gemini Cleaning Services. Your cleaning appointment has been secured.</p>

            <h3>Booking Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Service Type:</strong> {{serviceType}}</li>
                <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{scheduledDate}}</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> {{address}}</li>
                <li><strong>Amount Paid:</strong> ${{amount}}</li>
                <li><strong>Payment Method:</strong> {{paymentMethod}}</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>What Happens Next:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Your cleaning slot is now reserved</li>
                <li>Our team will arrive at the scheduled time</li>
                <li>Please ensure someone is available to provide access to the premises</li>
            </ul>

            <p><strong>Important:</strong> If you need to make any changes to your booking, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>
            
            <p>We look forward to providing you with excellent cleaning service!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2024 Gemini Cleaning Services. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
